    LLM: 'Count trumps and Kings; avoid discarding counting cards as dealer when possible. In Solo, demand high trumps or Kings.\n\nTime when to play the Fool so it goes to a trick your side wins. Save high trumps for key tricks.\n\nIn call games, infer partner from who supports your leads. In Solo, manage the exchange to strengthen your long suits.',
